hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2902","###\n It was narrated to us by Bundar, who said: It was narrated to us by Yahya, from Abd al-Malik. And it was narrated to us by Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim, who said: It was narrated to us by Hushaym, who informed us that Abd al-Malik narrated to us, from Ata', from Jabir (RA), who said: \We used to perform Tamattu' (Umrah followed by Hajj with a break in between) during the time of the Messenger of Allah ("""""
